    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "team_0130_cassiopeia_02",
      "hash64": "17FB7679349FF490",
      "text": "Ich bin Big Boss... und Cassiopeia...[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "team_0130_cassiopeia_03",
      "hash64": "17FB7779349FF643",
      "text": "Als ich gesehen habe, wie du vor der Akademie\\nkurzen Prozess mit den Handlangern von\\r\\nTeam Star gemacht hast, kam mir die Idee für\\r\\nOperation Stardust.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 155,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "team_0130_cassiopeia_04",
      "hash64": "17FB7C79349FFEC2",
      "text": "Da du LP gebraucht hast und ich sie dank meines\\nKönnens mit Leichtigkeit besorgen konnte,\\r\\nboten sie den idealen Anreiz für dich,\\r\\nTeil von Operation Stardust zu werden.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 173,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "team_0130_cassiopeia_05",
      "hash64": "17FB7D7934A00075",
      "text": "Als Teil des Versorgungstrupps konnte ich dich\\ndann die ganze Zeit im Auge behalten.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "team_0130_cassiopeia_06",
      "hash64": "17FB7A79349FFB5C",
      "text": "Um Team Star ein endgültiges Ende zu setzen,\\nmusst du nur noch mich besiegen.\\c\\nAlles, was du bis hierher für mich getan hast,\\ngalt diesem Ziel.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "team_0130_cassiopeia_07",
      "hash64": "17FB7B79349FFD0F",
      "text": "Aber... ein Teil von mir hängt an Team Star und\\nwill nicht zulassen, dass es aufgelöst wird.\\c\\nDeshalb bringe ich es nicht übers Herz,\\nmich einfach kampflos zu ergeben.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 169,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "team_0130_cassiopeia_08",
      "hash64": "17FB807934A0058E",
      "text": "Nun denn... Der letzte Kampf steht bevor.\\nBist du bereit?[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "team_0130_select_01",
      "hash64": "EFD0A6A14311F550",
      "text": "Ich bin bereit!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "team_0130_select_02",
      "hash64": "EFD0A9A14311FA69",
      "text": "Noch nicht...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "team_0130_cassiopeia_09",
      "hash64": "17FB817934A00741",
      "text": "Okay. Triff deine Vorbereitungen und komm\\ndann zurück.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "team_0130_cassiopeia_10",
      "hash64": "17FE7E7934A237FF",
      "text": "Ich danke dir.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "team_0130_nelke_01",
      "hash64": "11FE19CFDF6E4CF5",
      "text": "Yo, sorry für die Verspätung!\\c\\nDas Schreiben für Señora Quendella hat mi--\\nÄhm, die Vorbereitungen haben etwas länger\\r\\ngedauert als gedacht.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 144,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "team_0130_cassiopeia_11",
      "hash64": "17FE7D7934A2364C",
      "text": "Diese Stimme... Bist du das, Leval?[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "team_0130_nelke_03",
      "hash64": "11FE17CFDF6E498F",
      "text": "Du bist es also wirklich, Cosim--\\nÄh, ich meine... Bist du das, Cassiopeia?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "team_0130_cassiopeia_12",
      "hash64": "17FE807934A23B65",
      "text": "Höchstpersönlich. Ich habe eine Bitte an dich,\\nLeval.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "team_0130_cassiopeia_13",
      "hash64": "17FE7F7934A239B2",
      "text": "Wir brauchen ein Video von dem, was hier gleich\\npassieren wird. Ich will, dass alle Team-Mitglieder\\r\\nüber den Ausgang des Kampfes Bescheid wissen.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 148,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "team_0130_nelke_04",
      "hash64": "11FE14CFDF6E4476",
      "text": "O-Okay, verstanden.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "team_0130_cassiopeia_14",
      "hash64": "17FE7A7934A23133",
      "text": "Ich denke, es wäre angebracht, dass ich mich\\nnoch einmal vorstelle.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "team_0130_cassiopeia_15",
      "hash64": "17FE797934A22F80",
      "text": "Ich bin Team Stars Big Boss. Mein Name ist\\nCassiopeia...[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "team_0130_cassiopeia_16",
      "hash64": "17FE7C7934A23499",
      "text": "Nein... Cosima![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "team_0130_cassiopeia_17",
      "hash64": "17FE7B7934A232E6",
      "text": "Die Gründerin von Team Star ist kampfbereit!\\nVerneigt euch vor meiner unermesslichen Kraft![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
